# <%= projectName %>

Shared SCSS: design tokens, light/dark themes and mixins.

| File                        | Contents                                         |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| `src/tokens/_index.scss`    | `$color-*`, `$spacing-*`, `$radius-*`, `$breakpoints` |
| `src/themes/_index.scss`    | `theme-light` / `theme-dark` mixins (CSS custom properties) |
| `src/mixins/_index.scss`    | `breakpoint-up($name)`                           |
| `src/_index.scss`           | forwards all of the above                        |

## Use it in an app

Add the lib's `src` folder to the app's Sass include paths in `project.json` →
`targets.build.options`:

```json
"stylePreprocessorOptions": { "includePaths": ["<%= projectRoot %>/src"] }
```

Then, in any SCSS file of the app:

```scss
@use 'index' as <%= propertyName %>;

:root {
  @include <%= propertyName %>.theme-light;
}

.card {
  padding: <%= propertyName %>.$spacing-md;

  @include <%= propertyName %>.breakpoint-up(md) {
    padding: <%= propertyName %>.$spacing-lg;
  }
}
```

Single parts can be loaded too: `@use 'tokens';`, `@use 'mixins';`.
